### Known gaps (see DECISIONS-FOR-MORNING.md)

- Narrative/GM prose, worked examples and story seeds across all chapters.
- The 114 sidebars (Text Boxes) and ~18 rules tables (aura tables, etc.).
- Things-of-Virtue individual write-up prose (displaced in extraction).

These are surfaced for owner disposition rather than silently deferred or faked.
